			description: [
				"&6Nichrome&r is an alloy of &6Nickel&r and &6Chrome&r."
				""
				"This alloy is cooked in an &3Electric Blast Furnace&r into a &6Hot Nichrome Ingot&r which will damage you if it is held. To prevent this damage and obtain the desired ingot, the Hot Ingot must be cooled in a &3Vacuum Freezer&r."
				""
				"It is best to directly route this Hot Ingot from the &6Output Bus&r of your Blast Furnace to the &6Input Bus&r of your &3Vacuum Freezer&r via pipes or a &6Tag Filter&r set to 'forge:hot_ingots' with a high priority."
			]
