		{
			dependencies: [
				"0E20199737DFE4AC"
				"1F2E76FA4B2C2E84"
			]
			description: [
				"&9Diesel&r is a mixture of &9Light Fuel&r and &9Heavy Fuel&r."
				""
				"The primary use is for making &2Cetane-Boosted Diesel&r, which you will want to stockpile in large quantities for the later production of &6Cryolobus&r. &2Alternatively, &6Gasoline&2 can be used for that purpose, and later be upgraded into &6High Octane Gasoline&2 and &6JEAN Gasoline&r."
				""
				"The performance of Combustion Generators is also improved, but you probably want to refine Diesel anyway."
				""
				"&2While it is more power efficient to use singleblock Distilleries over a Distillation Tower for Oil, it is still recommended to use Distillation Towers, to get the other useful byproducts too. For Diesel, the correct ratio is 3 Distilleries for Light Oil and 2 Distilleries for Heavy Oil."
			]
