		{
			dependencies: ["4C76017864258EA9"]
			description: [
				"&6High-Octane Gasoline&r &2is an even more powerful combustion fuel, generating 3200 EU per mB of fuel. It can also be used in Cryolobus production, using 75%% less fuel than Cetane-Boosted Diesel or normal Gasoline. The trade-off is the very complex processing lines you must set up for it.&r"
				""
				"To refine Gasoline to High-Octane Gasoline, you will need:"
				"- 20 parts Gasoline"
				"- 2 parts Octane"
				"- 2 parts Nitrous Oxide"
				"- 1 part Toluene"
				"- 1 part Ethyl Tertbutyl Ether"
				""
				"To get the most out of this, run it in an Extreme Combustion Engine with Liquid Oxygen."
