			description: [
				"&6Sodium Hydroxide&r is a strong base, and an ingredient in &6Bio Diesel&r, among other reactions."
				""
				"The primary source is splitting &6Salt Water&r in an &3Electrolyzer&r - this is also a good source of &6Chlorine&r. You can get Salt Water from mixing &6Salt&r and &6Water&r (duh), dissolving &6Ghast Tears&r, or drilling it from Salt Water fluid veins, which only spawn over oceans."
