				""
				"For now, Tungsten can only be refined from &6Scheelite Dust&r or &6Wolframite Dust&r. They come in ore form from a Tier Two Micro Miner (T2MM) mission. The other two Tungsten ore types, &6Tungstate&r and &6Stolzite&r, require an &9IV&r Chemical Bath."
