		{
			dependencies: ["785C6332FC7A07A5"]
			description: [
				"&9Deepslate Processing is one way to source &9Fluorine&r and &6Thorium&r."
				""
				"&6Fluorine&r is needed in &6Polytetrafluoroethylene (PTFE)&r, and many future chemical processes."
				""
				"&3Rock Breakers&r are first used to achieve renewable &6Deepslate&r. This recipe runs at &5EV&r or higher."
				""
				"After this, &3Macerators&r should pulverise the Deepslate into &6Deepslate Dust&r, with a chance of producing &6Thorium&r."
				""
				"A &3Centrifuge&r then turns Deepslate Dust into &6Biotite Dust&r and &6Silicon Dioxide Dust&r. The latter can be electrolysed, yielding &6Silicon&r and &6Oxygen&r."
				""
				"Biotite Dust is then finally put into an &3Electrolyser&r. This yields &6Potassium, Magnesium, Aluminium&r and &6Silicon Dust&r, as well as some &6Fluorine&r."
			]
			id: "5FB696EF1D2412F5"
			rewards: [{
				id: "29E845DD3A0B570F"
				item: "kubejs:moni_nickel"
				type: "item"
