		{
			dependencies: ["595F205B551A53C9"]
			dependency_requirement: "one_completed"
			description: [
				"Often called the Platline, refining &6Platinum Group Sludge&r (PGS) into the platinum group metals requires quite a long processing line. Right now, you only have access to the first part of the line: the extraction of &6Ruthenium&r and &6Rhodium&r."
				""
				"Treating certain ores with &6Nitric Acid&r yields &6PGS&r - &6Sheldonite&r has the highest yields, but others might be easier to gather. Then, using an &6HV&r+ &3Centrifuge&r and &6Aqua Regia&r, break that down into the PGS salts, and reduce those salts to the metals."
				""
				"You will need Ruthenium and Rhodium in &6RTM Coils&r, the &3Alloy Blast Smelter&r, and various &9IV&r components."
			]
			id: "044553423097C3C7"
			rewards: [{
				count: 2
