		{
			dependencies: ["6DBD1492197AC92D"]
			description: [
				"Micro miners that perform combat require a special microverse, a &3Hostile Microverse&r. To create one, declare war on a Normal microverse with a bomb strapped to a &6T2.5MM&r."
				""
				"A Hostile Microverse behaves very different from a Normal microverse. Hostile microverses cannot be repaired with &6Quantum Flux&r, and decay naturally even when no recipe is running. However, as your micro miner thins the hordes, stability is restored to the microverse."
				""
				"You will need to run missions periodically to prevent the collapse of the Hostile microverse, making it quite the challenge to automate. Consider using a &6Microverse Stability Sensor Hatch&r to help."
			]
