		{
			dependencies: ["476F71CC0B0AC2A4"]
			description: [
				"By combining &6Uraninite Dust&r with &6Hydrofluoric Acid&r and &6Fluorine&r or &6Hexafluorosilicic Acid&r and &3electrolyzing&r the products, &6Uranium 238&r and &6Uranium 235&r can be extracted."
				""
				"Uranium 238 can also be obtained from &3macerating&r &6Red Granite&r, renewably sourced from a &3rock breaker&r. However, this method is drastically slower than processing Uraninite."
				""
				"Uraninite is a byproduct from a variety of ores, and can be &3centrifuged&r from &6Pitchblende&r. Alternatively, &6Uraninite Ore&r can be mined out of the ground or obtained from microminer missions."
			]
