				"78DCEF2FF2E1AC8C"
			]
			description: [
				"Like &9Sodium Persulfate&r and &9Iron III Chloride&r before it, &9Oxalic Acid&r is used as an etchant for &6Circuit Boards&r."
				""
				"Unlike the previous etchants, &9Oxalic Acid&r won't be necessary until &5EV&r, where it is used in certain processing lines like &aCoal Fly Ash Processing&r for Germanium."
