		{
			dependencies: [
				"785C6332FC7A07A5"
				"7ABC7057BC2E8CE4"
			]
			description: [
				"When burning &6Coal&r or &6Coke&r in the &3Pyrolyse Oven&r or &3Chemical Reactor&r there is a chance to produce a special type of Ash called &6Coal Fly Ash&r."
				""
				"You'll regret trashing it, since this type of ash is more mineral-rich than most regular types of ash. It yields &6Nickel&r, &6Zinc&r, &6Gallium&r, &6Lithium&r, &6Vanadium&r and, most importantly, &6Germanium&r."
				""
				"The full processing line will require &9Oxalic Acid Solution&r, but you've had access to that for a few tiers by now."
				""
				"A note on Germanium: like &6Indium&r, it's only used in small amounts for alloys. As such, it's not worth gathering extreme quantities as you might with common resources like &6Iron&r, &6Copper&r, &6Tin&r, or &6Redstone&r."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:germanium_dust"
			id: "63C3077124BC81FD"
